      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan4_SanQiDaoGong_L053",
      "original_quote": "到艮有人著青衣至",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan4_SanQiDaoGong_L054",
      "original_quote": "小兒哭泣或童子手拿銅鐵器物為應",
